"note_claim": "Mitch McConnell is alive and his office stated he continues to improve in the hospital and is working with his staff.",
"label": "SUPPORTS",
"quote": "\"The Senator continues to improve, and is working closely with his staff on Kentucky and Senate matters while the Senate is out of session,\" the statement continued.",
"reason": "The article directly quotes the senator's office confirming he is improving and working with staff, substantiating the note's claim that he is alive."
